          "id": 2532304656,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "This also creates an auto preference of the same name, and replaces the first value with the new one. To register two ports by default, you would want to define a range:\n\n```\n#define PORTS_AS_DR \"925-926\"\n...\ndissector_add_uint_range_with_preference(\"udp.port\", PORTS_AC_DR, acdr_dissector_handle);\n```",
